					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Hey guys for all that dont know Kandayil is getting married on Sunday after next.. 2pm EST On The wooden bridge in NK,So everyone come if possable						</td>
					</tr>
										<tr>
						<td class="body" align="left">
							<br>
							<div class="xsmall">
							<i>Edited by <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3513">mezmrizr</a> on 2/7/2002 - 12:39 PM PST</i>
							</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3621">Kandayil</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">2/7/2002 - 7:58 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2908">Kandayil Darksoother</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														I am Looking for good Attendance here folks.. so if you can.... Please make it.. Any gifts are completely optional.. And alcohol will be Served.. (so i'm pretty sure all the dwarves will be There) And i'm sure there will be some party favors.. You can bring your own if You Want... The more the merrier...<br />
<br />
Kandayil Darksoother						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3597">Kaledine</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">2/8/2002 - 3:48 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2879">Kaledine Ursamaje</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2917">Karuune Bogglesworth</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2918">Dambae Meadowlark</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Doh, I wish I could be there :(  Unfortunately, as many of you know, I am no longer allowed near EQ, and have therefore taken to sneaking one day a week, which is Thursday, which is when I get my &quot;day pass&quot;.  So, much as I'd like to be there, I can't.  Kand, I wish you the most mazal (luck), and I hope everyone from the guild that can be there is!  <br />
<br />
Btw, who's the lucky chica?						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3574">Rakarr</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">2/9/2002 - 5:14 AM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2921">Rakarr Ursamaje</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														I don't think I can be there, either... I'd love to be, but for me, it's like 1am on a school night. I'll see what I can do, though.						</td>
					</tr>
															</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=3538">Aprilmoon</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">2/9/2002 - 9:07 AM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2825">Aprilmoon Swiftarrow</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2951">Questorsmuse</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Would that be Feb. 17th at 2:00?  Just wanted the full date and time out there.  I will be there.  Could I ask though, why the wood bridge?  With all the wonderfully beautiful places in the world of Norrath and its moon Luclin I would think you could find a great spot.  Does it have a History for you and your betrothed?  If so, do tell us.  I love a great story.						</td>
